Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.51,0:00:34.34,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The death of the moonlight\Nis a strange man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky is the one who is lost, the\Nshadow of the great wolf. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only place to be is in\Nplace is the only place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are still in the end of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beat is still a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first time we've been in the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,THE END
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.01,0:02:06.10,Title 3,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,930)\pos(175,700)\fscx83}Episode 25: Iggy the Fool and Geb's N'Doul, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that noise, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the update, Captain Obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here from the\NSpeedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're looking for somewhere to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon Foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct me if I'm wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but aren't they the group that's\Nlooking after Mom back in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're old friends of yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's them all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we taking a helicopter\Nfrom here on out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd like to, the guys working\Nfor the Foundation aren't stand users,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we'd be putting them in\Nharm's way if we hitched a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if they're not here to give\Nus a ride, what's the occasion then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They brought us our new ally. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turrigol. An ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to warn you,\Nit's a bit of a handful,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is the primary reason\Nit took so long to fetch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, you aren't seriously\Nconsidering taking him with us, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His presence here would only hold us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he might actually harm us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.07,0:03:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This new ally of ours, are you\Nsaying that he's a stand user too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right, and his stand is\Nrepresented by the card known as the Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, the Fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a pretty stupid\Ncard if you want my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should count your blessings\Nthat he's on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest watching your mouth if\Nyou know what's good for you, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now move your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who died and made you the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The helicopter's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have been rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, which one of you is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're gonna answer me or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it you? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither of us is the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, quit joking\Naround! What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the guy really short or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a rough copter ride,\Nso he's in a foul mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already told you this guy is trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is asking where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this dog is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, this dog possesses\Nthe stand of the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Iggy, and he's crazy about\Nripping chunks of hair out of people's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest with you, I'm\Nnot sure where he's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Avdol found him in New York after none\Nof the dog catchers could wrangle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's thanks to Avdol that\Nhe's not roaming the streets now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's something that I\Nprobably should have mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he's in the middle of ripping\Nout someone's hair, he likes to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass gas in their face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a disgusting habit, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that thing is the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we were in Singapore, we fought\Nan orangutan stand user, but this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does this stupid mutt think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me turn you into dog meat!
