Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turned into sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't cut him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand is solidified and\Ngrabbed hold of my rapier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the dog's stand is made\Nentirely out of sand. Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As simple as the design is, it's so\Npowerful I'm not sure I could land a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, what are you doing? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this dog off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Polnareff, but if it's all the\Nsame to you, I'd like to keep my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to bring his\Nfavorite snack with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have come with us otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dog's sense of smell is\Nsimply incredible. And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coffee flavored chewing gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Iggy will do just about anything\Nto savor this tasty little morsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Mr. Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly, hide the packet before you—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He grabbed the whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't get enough of his\Ncoffee-flavored gum, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People, on the other hand, are a\Ndifferent story, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least he can do is\Ntake the wrapping off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is a gum-obsessed feral\Ndog supposed to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that little menace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's completely ruined\Nmy picturesque hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Partied corn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be distracted while\Nhe's chewing his gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get the supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the food and water you'll\Nbe needing for your trip, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are medical supplies\Nand a change of clothes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also took the liberty of buying\Na new camera to use with your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose it'll be a lot\Neasier than using a TV, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look sharp, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a perfect memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, hurry up and give\Nthem up the stupid gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why in the world would I do that, when the\Ntwo of you are already such good friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Folder-Ev?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's everything, I think\Nwe're going to be heading back now, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer this before you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:08:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's regarding my daughter's condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want you to be straight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's my baby girl holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to be perfectly frank with you,\Nsir, it's not looking good right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's rapidly losing strength, and\Nnothing seems to help her condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our doctors at the Speedwagon Foundation\Nsay she has two weeks at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're all out of time this is bullshit\Ni also have some other information sir
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our investigators say that two days ago\Nnine unidentified men and women gathered
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a building believed to be dio's hideout\Napparently they came and left together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dio has rounded up nine\Nmore people we have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no clue who they are the spy who reported
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this was killed shortly after And the\Nmansion where they met has been vacated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've had no luck in\Nlocating these individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought about tailing them, but\Nsince our spies aren't stand users,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we decided it would be too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these people are stand users? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than whole horses stand the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only tarot card that\Nstill remains is the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been suspecting that one\Nbelongs to Dio, but now I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't wrap my head around this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine more stand users?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I can gather,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems that Dio's head hasn't been\Nable to adjust to his new body yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that monster would never run from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's far too conceited\Nfor something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll do everything within his\Npower to keep us out of Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to take out nine\Nstand users in two weeks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that is one hell of a whirlwind tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.28,0:10:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We await your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look after my holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, it sniffed out the Great\NEndul from that far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost caught it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bit more practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of this because of the tsetse fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not for those insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe Starr and his band of meddlers would\Nnever have known Master Dio was in Egypt.
