Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, why are you letting\Nhim get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not farigus to be in the backseat\Nwhile we're stuck in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in case you didn't know, it's\Nnot exactly spacious back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need a chiropractor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I know it's not ideal,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you'll just have to wait\Nuntil the gum runs out of flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it does, throw another stick of gum\Ninto the trunk to lure him back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can all switch seats with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, calm\Ndown already, fleabag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quickly, look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Speedwagon Foundation\Nhelicopter went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of an\Nexplosion or gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like it just fell out\Nof the sky for no reason at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be? Careful, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet my life it was\Nattacked by an enemy's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the pilot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happened to\Nhim, it wasn't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Approach carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever did this could\Nstill be hiding in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way all that water is\Njust from his mouth it must be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flowing from somewhere else it\Nmust be from his lungs and the fish
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would mean he drowned in the\Ndesert this is getting weirder and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weirder what is going on hey we found\Nthe other guy over here he's alive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to talk to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.30,0:14:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you need water?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand me the canteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you just hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.82,0:14:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:14:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water attacked us! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, watch yourselves! It's a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's stand is inside the canteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were just innocent bystanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What reason did it have to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, did you see what kind\Nof stand we're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw the shape of a hand, but I'd\Nwager it's still inside the canteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe I saw it leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.58,0:15:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could the user be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Foundation members informed us Dio\Nhad a meeting with nine men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that one\Nof them is the assassin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I need you to find the\Nstand user. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm already on it. That said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything around\Nus, let alone the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we duked it out with that sun\Nstand, he was hiding behind a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:16:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the enemy seems to be so far away that\Nwe'll never be able to find him from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, slice up\Nthe canteen, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, didn't you see\Nwhat happened to the pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His entire head got sucked into\Nthat tiny little container!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I so much as poke a\Nhole in that thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you slice it up, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're closer anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can just use your emerald\Nsplash and call it a day, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me do something just\Nbecause you don't want to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've said no, and that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, like I said, I'm not going\Nto attack the damn thing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand left the canteen disguised\Nas water and hid in the blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand wasn't disguising\Nitself as water at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the stand is the water! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It closed up Kakyoin's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panicking isn't going to help anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summon Chariot for protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll get Polnareff too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would it go after the pilot's corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't the corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The target was the watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It attacked the watch\Nbecause of the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:17:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand stalks its victims\Nby sound. You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, Polaramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming for you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get to the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.68,0:18:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster, pull the ref!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.02,0:18:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand disappeared into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It detects sound through\Nvibrations in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it moves through the earth\Nso there's no way to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That puts us at a major disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we can't see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stand has the ability to attack from\Nabove or below at any moment it chooses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make things worse, the stand\Nuser could be kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the prey has sought\Nrefuge atop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems they've realized Undul is using the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power of sound to hunt\Nthem down one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before\Nthey're all eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's Kakyoin doing? Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things,\Nhe may have been blinded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs to see a doctor\Nas soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.28,0:19:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we try to move from this\Nspot, that stand will attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford careless mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the dog. Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It leapt out of the car\Nbefore I could attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It anticipated what my\Nstand was going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like this dog is going\Nto be quite the nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tires are in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, what now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole car's about to be pulled in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold him for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, we have to move to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you good-for-nothing mongrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to be\Nhelping us or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that accursed dog is too\Nperceptive for his own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It knows I'm four kilometers\Nwest of Joestar's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should do away\Nwith the dog right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sleep while we fight to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bastard, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, the dog is of no concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others can't\Ncontrol that mongrel anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mutt's harmless if all it does is nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch, the water's sharp\Nenough to slash through our front tires!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move to the other side on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's trying to do what I think it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we're going to need\Nto hang on for our lives!
